    "h1_source": "MEASURED ON-CHAIN, because DexScreener returned h1=null on the deepest pair this run (and null on 3 of 5 Base pairs). The pool's own blockTimestampLast is STILL 1792900663 = 03:57:43Z, i.e. NO SWAP for 63.9 minutes; reserves byte-identical at blk 53055774 and blk 53057574. Therefore -0.189% is 100% the QUOTE LEG: VIRTUAL/USD 0.627966 -> 0.626781 between those blocks. Textbook TELL 11: an API null is not a flat tape, and a flat RATIO is not a flat USD mark.",
