    "mark_note": "Premium/discount story is MOOT this hour: deep pool $0.01730 vs USDC V3 $0.01720 / $0.01721 / $0.01732 = under 1bp apart. No arb was possible and none occurred - USDC venues did only 41.76 DEUS of volume all hour, both BUYS, both ERC-4337 userops whose payers ended at exactly 0 DEUS (tell #6 pass-through, not a bid).",
