    "read": "REAL NEW MONEY, HELD — not arb, not pass-through. Three tests: (1) the DEUS ends in the EOA's own balance and STAYS (284,371 now), it is not forwarded in the same tx; (2) the balance was EXACTLY 0.0 at -30d, satisfying tell #8 for new money, and flat at 168,772.64 across -7d/-24h/-6h/-1h, meaning it had not traded DEUS at all in the last week until today; (3) it bought across FOUR venues in one sweep, which is directional intent (a single best-price buy), not a two-leg arb (tell #9 - an arb would show a sell leg on another venue, and there is none in these txs). This is the first directional buyer of size on record since 0x7f6aba75 bought 335,249 on 2026-10-24. Position is now 284,371 DEUS (~$4,889), up from 168,773. Watch whether it holds or distributes — a holder this fresh is a leading indicator for follow-through.",
