    "price_impact_note": "Reserves blk 53033945 -> 53033946: VIRTUAL 527,586.96 -> 525,733.60, DEUS 18,874,999.34 -> 18,941,539.11 (absorbed 66,539.78 net of the 672.12 fee rebate to 0x205db642). One block, -0.70% on the pool mark.",
